# The measure mode (an extension): Analyze > Measure Selection checks
# in the menu, and measuring adds no constraint.
key s
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 400 250
down L 400 250
up L 400 250
key esc
key esc
move 300 225
down L 300 225
up L 300 225
menu Analyze|Measure Selection
menus
dump
key e ctrl shift
dump
